// Tests hex.read_entry n (n = 1, 2, 3, 4), hex.read_entry_byte and hex.read_entry_packed nb (nb = 1, 2, 3, 4):
//   entry sizes 1, 2, 4 take the shift, 3 the constant multiply. Indexes 0, the last, a random one and 1, each
//   held in a 1, 2, 3 and 4-hex idx. The arrays are 256 random entries (python, seed 20261024).
// Each check prints '=' when the result is right.
